{"id":"n14794-1-7","stage":3,"title":"동그라미 · 圆","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14794-1-7-1","ko":"오늘이 아버지 생신인데 왜 아직도 안 들어오니?","zh":"今天是爸爸的生日，你怎么还没回来啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘이","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘이","audio":"/audio/c4a432f0e61abb21e6b8.mp3"}},{"text":"아버지","meaning":"父亲，爸爸","explanation":"아버지：父亲，爸爸。","readings":[{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71343","senseId":"1","lemma":"아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아버지","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3"}},{"text":"생신인데","meaning":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","explanation":"생신：寿辰，诞辰，生日；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"생신","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16595","senseId":"1","lemma":"생신","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생신인데","audio":"/audio/07696e8db2322946c34f.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"들어오니?","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어오니","audio":"/audio/aa9426881e1fa08c6a54.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"af4870c15b98485b","term":"아버지","zh":"父亲，爸爸","audio":"/audio/af4870c15b98485bf462.mp3","entryId":"71343","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的男子。","pronunciation":["아버지"]},{"id":"17bf3766fa611ae9","term":"생신","zh":"寿辰，诞辰，生日","audio":"/audio/17bf3766fa611ae9c913.mp3","entryId":"16595","definition":"(敬语)人出生的日子。","pronunciation":["생신"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3","entryId":"74105","definition":"从某个范围外往里移动。","pronunciation":["드러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1c0f6f188ef76f6c6e77.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14794-1-7-2","ko":"아! 달력에 동그라미까지 쳐 두고 깜빡했어!","zh":"啊！我还在日历上标了圈，结果给忘了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아!","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦。","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"달력에","meaning":"日历","explanation":"달력：日历；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달력","audio":"/audio/965833d955bd6c16d185.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60489","senseId":"1","lemma":"달력","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달력에","audio":"/audio/3f6d1f4f190e7b26e3d8.mp3"}},{"text":"동그라미까지","meaning":"圆，圆圈","explanation":"동그라미：圆，圆圈；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"동그라미","audio":"/audio/d110cb250c186f31b2dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14794","senseId":"1","lemma":"동그라미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동그라미까지","audio":"/audio/f2270f0b51abe6de329a.mp3"}},{"text":"쳐","meaning":"画","explanation":"치다：画；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"치다","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79090","senseId":"1","lemma":"치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쳐","audio":"/audio/67f68907535c3fdeaceb.mp3"}},{"text":"두고","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"두고","audio":"/audio/b825f2c9e380ab51c58d.mp3"}},{"text":"깜빡했어!","meaning":"忘，遗忘，忘掉","explanation":"깜빡하다：忘，遗忘，忘掉；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"깜빡하다","audio":"/audio/ee75d5588acef9bdc9a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37737","senseId":"3","lemma":"깜빡하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"깜빡했어","audio":"/audio/2268bb9f8f558f4b5ab7.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"965833d955bd6c16","term":"달력","zh":"日历","audio":"/audio/965833d955bd6c16d185.mp3","entryId":"60489","definition":"把一年的月、日、星期、季节和节假日等按日期记载的册子。","pronunciation":["달력"]},{"id":"d110cb250c186f31","term":"동그라미","zh":"圆，圆圈","audio":"/audio/d110cb250c186f31b2dc.mp3","entryId":"14794","definition":"圆圆的样子。","pronunciation":["동그라미"]},{"id":"5f8f6895b9ea6a97","term":"치다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/5f8f6895b9ea6a978677.mp3","entryId":"79090","definition":"用毛笔或铅笔等点点儿或画线、画图。","pronunciation":["치다"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"ee75d5588acef9bd","term":"깜빡하다","zh":"忘，遗忘，忘掉","audio":"/audio/ee75d5588acef9bdc9a1.mp3","entryId":"37737","definition":"没有记住或没注意。","pronunciation":["깜빠카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4e8f0b166fe5b5ee595.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.129,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14794","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":109,"sequenceScore":2.8543,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊！我还在日历上标了圈，结果给忘了！","今天是爸爸的生日，你怎么还没回来啊？","我每周骑三次自行车。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天是爸爸的生日，你怎么还没回来啊？","我每周骑三次自行车。","啊！我还在日历上标了圈，结果给忘了！"],"answer":2}]}
